#: admin/tab-templates/bupr-setting-support-tab.php:19
msgid "How can we submit the review to a member profile by using this plugin?"
msgstr ""

#: admin/tab-templates/bupr-setting-support-tab.php:23
msgid ""
"When visiting the \"/members\" section in the site, go for single profile "
"view page, there you can see a menu namely, \"Reviews\" that will allow you "
"if you are a site member to add profile review"
msgstr ""

#: admin/tab-templates/bupr-setting-support-tab.php:31
msgid "What does the admin settings mean?"
msgstr ""

#: admin/tab-templates/bupr-setting-support-tab.php:35
msgid ""
"The admin settings modifies the review creation template. If the popup "
"allowed is checked, the form is will appear in a popup, otherwise the form "
"will toggle on the same page."
msgstr ""

#: admin/tab-templates/bupr-setting-support-tab.php:43
msgid "How can we add more rating criteria for review form ?"
msgstr ""

#: admin/tab-templates/bupr-setting-support-tab.php:47
msgid ""
"Just go to \"Dashboard->Review->BP member review setting page\" and click "
"add criteria button to add more fields and click save setting button to "
"update review settings."
msgstr ""

#: admin/tab-templates/bupr-setting-support-tab.php:55
msgid "What is the Top Members widget and how to use it ?"
msgstr ""

#: admin/tab-templates/bupr-setting-support-tab.php:59
msgid ""
"Members Review widgets display list of members on site front-end . When you "
"successfully activate BP Member profile review plugin. Then you can see "
"Members reivew widget in the widget section."
msgstr ""

#: admin/tab-templates/bupr-setting-support-tab.php:67
msgid "Can I use the review form on any other page?"
msgstr ""

#: admin/tab-templates/bupr-setting-support-tab.php:70
